# EXTENSION to patrol_brique_incumbent_rdb3_seeds.jobs — take both arms to
# EIGHT seeds, because at five the test cannot reject on the branch that matters.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS. Issue #56 sized the original six-run design and it is right:
# at five seeds the campaign can produce a significant result on 1 of its 64
# possible outcomes, and that one requires seed 16 to go MUTE at rdb=1.0.
#
#     v23 (seed 16, rdb=1.0)   rdb=1.0 arm   Fisher ceiling   rejecting outcomes
#     MUTE                     1/5           0.0476           one: rdb3 = 5/5
#     REPORTING                2/5           0.1667           none
#
# Seed 16's only patrol_brique observation REPORTS (v17_pre42, 0.794), and
# b08d806 retracted the claim that the chart block controls this channel — so
# the seed-determined reading predicts v23 reports and the design lands in the
# row that can never reject. The exact-McNemar ceiling on the paired reading is
# 0.0625 at five pairs and 0.125 conditioned on the arm as measured, so pairing
# does not rescue it either. The asymmetry is the point: "3.0 splits too" is
# settled DESCRIPTIVELY by the first mute cell and needs no inference at all,
# while "the price is real" is the branch that needs a test — and it was the
# branch the five-seed design could not certify.
#
# Eight seeds is where both readings become capable (Fisher ceiling 0.0070,
# paired 0.0312). That is 12 new runs total: the original six plus these six.
#
#     arm       seeds 12-15      seed 16      seeds 17-19
#     rdb=3.0   v18-v21 (new)    v22 (new)    v24,v25,v26  <- here
#     rdb=1.0   v7,v10,v11,v12   v23 (new)    v27,v28,v29  <- here
#
# NOT a rank test: closed_on_root_report_rate reads a FLOOR of 0.020-0.104 on a
# wholly mute arm, so its low mode is instrument artifact and Mann-Whitney would
# be ranking noise. The quantity is binary or it is nothing.
#
# Launched chained behind the original queue rather than in parallel: two live
# queues contend for the same cores and both slow down.
patrol_brique_v24_rdb3_seed17  --scenario patrol_brique --total-steps 3000000 --seed 17 --reward root_done_bonus=3.0
patrol_brique_v25_rdb3_seed18  --scenario patrol_brique --total-steps 3000000 --seed 18 --reward root_done_bonus=3.0
patrol_brique_v26_rdb3_seed19  --scenario patrol_brique --total-steps 3000000 --seed 19 --reward root_done_bonus=3.0
patrol_brique_v27_rdb1_seed17  --scenario patrol_brique --total-steps 3000000 --seed 17
patrol_brique_v28_rdb1_seed18  --scenario patrol_brique --total-steps 3000000 --seed 18
patrol_brique_v29_rdb1_seed19  --scenario patrol_brique --total-steps 3000000 --seed 19
